# Content/ — binary UE assets (.uasset / .umap) are editor-generated.
#
# Binary assets cannot be authored by hand and are regenerated on first editor
# open / first save, so they are gitignored by default. Source-controlled
# fixture levels (see demo/README.md → "Smoke fixtures") may be force-added
# with `git add -f` once they are stable; the .gitignore keeps a clean tree
# while the editor churns the folder during smoke runs.
*.uasset
*.umap
*.bak
